module test.retirement.namespace_unique_on_chain_policy_retained
import test.retirement.model {
  RetainedNonMigratable,
  TestModuleRetirement,
}

data namespace_unique_on_chain_policy_retention: TestModuleRetirement = TestModuleRetirement {
  module: "namespace_unique_on_chain_policy_test.rs",
  disposition: RetainedNonMigratable {
    reason: "The namespace-resolution-design.md section-13 / namespace-canonical-binding keystone witness toggles the host thread-local NameResolutionPolicy gate (v1_rt.name_resolution_policy_set_namespace_only) between ImportScoped and NamespaceOnlyY, then compiles homonym / zero-on-chain / off-chain fixtures and asserts BOTH toggle values refuse through the one module_path_owner_binding_decide fold — AmbiguousReference for on-chain homonyms, UnresolvedType for zero-on-chain (never widened to Ambiguous), and no nearest-wins / first-hit bypass when the obsolete host gate is false (policy_bracket_does_not_bypass_canonical_homonym_refusal). The gate is no longer a behavioral split; the retained rs proves the obsolete host toggle cannot bypass canonical binding. That thread-local process-state toggle is host-Rust-only and is unreachable from a dag witness (a substrate program has no handle to flip the seed interpreter's resolution policy), so this module cannot migrate to an exact-stem test dag floor witness. It is therefore RETAINED as rs, not migration debt and not a delete candidate. Hand-Rust receipt: gunbc.namespace_unique_on_chain_policy_scaffold is the ONE LOC census authority (checkable anchor gunbc.roadmap_authority namespace-canonical-binding; dissolve-on after→0), witnessed by dag/test/claim/namespace_unique_on_chain_policy_hand_rust_witness_test.dag. NO NUMBERS ARE REPEATED HERE, DELIBERATELY (review 45420): this row used to embed its own copy of the before/after/net census, and when the real receipt moved the copy stayed behind and became false without anyone touching this file -- a section 3 parallel representation of a fact the scaffold owns. Aligning the two copies would only reset the clock on the same drift, which is the same reason the scaffold itself stopped carrying absolute cli_run LOC (review 45409). Read the numbers from the scaffold rows; discriminating tests include zero_on_chain_containment_census_matches_inference_unresolved (inference/containment census parity). This retention dissolves when src/v1 is deleted at v2 self-host, at which point the policy gate and its host toggle cease to exist."
  }
}
